    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are privileged to introduce this fantastic 2-bedroom extended property to the market. This property is in a mature cul-de-sac of Bessborough Avenue, just off North Strand Road, which offers convenient access to the city centre, IFSC, Eastpoint business park and the Dublin docklands. Westwood gym, Clontarf promenade and Fairview Park within walking distance to Croke Park and the 3Arena. Transport bus, dart/train and LUAS services from Fairview and Connolly Stations. There is a wide selection of creches, pre-schools, primary and secondary schools to choose from.\r\n\r\nInternal living accommodation of c. 92 sq m comprises of entrance hallway, lounge, fully fitted kitchen, two double bedrooms and main family bathroom. No. 36 comes to the market in need of modernization throughout but does boast gas fired central heating, light filled interior, ample storage and sunny rear garden enhanced by a southerly orientation. Due to recent success in the area and based on location, type of property and potential, we know this will be extremely popular so please contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers on 0860136918 or 015411455 to arrange a viewing.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n- c. 92 Sq.m\r\n- BER E1\r\n- 2 bed/1 bath\r\n- Huge potential\r\n- Extended to the rear\r\n- Sunny rear garden with southerly aspect\r\n- Gas fired central heating\r\n- 2 spacious bedrooms\r\n- Light filled interior\r\n- Large lounge with feature fire place\r\n- Quiet cul de sac\r\n- Super location\r\n- Close to public transport links\r\n- Walking distance to local amenities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sales Team 1"
      }
    ],
